In the afternoon, we are standing on the canteen veranda.
It is me, Prakash, and Deepa there.
We are drinking hot tea.
Suddenly, the sky turned very black.
"I have never seen such a black sky," Deepa said.
Then, a heavy rain started.
This is the biggest rain of this season.
The wind blew and water splashed onto the veranda.
We stepped back a little.
It rained here in the morning too.
But now the rain has increased a lot.
"The monsoon season has truly started," Prakash said.
It is my first time seeing such heavy rain.
I noticed the loud sound of the rain.
We stood looking at the rain, drinking our tea.
A nice cold wind blew.
I liked this hot tea in the rain very much.
